License: MIT-style (permission notice reproduced in full at the top of both
alac.c and alac.h). Vendored VERBATIM — the decoder must not be rewritten; only
its build wrapper (CMakeLists.txt) and the separate pure-C fmtp mapper
(src/alac_config.c, include/alac_config.h, written for this project) are ours.

The decoder is the exact same compact single-file ALAC implementation that
shairport-sync feeds for AirPlay-1 (RAOP) audio, initialized directly from the
11 SDP `a=fmtp` integers (see alac_config.h).
